We segment $\xi^2$ into three ordered phases based on the evolution of $\sigma^*_t(g^1|\xi^{2}_{[0:t]})$ as defined below. 
While we impose a canonical ordering of Phases~$\x{1}$-$\x{3}$, we do not assume that all trajectories $\sigma^*_t$ naturally exhibit this temporal structure.
