The strategy profile $(\sigma^*,\gamma^*)$, where $\sigma^*$ is defined in~\eqref{eq: pi^E_A}, and $\gamma^*$ is defined in~\eqref{eq: xi_B} and \eqref{eq. Attacker's probabilities}, constitutes a weak PBNE as defined in Definition~\ref{def:PBNE}.
