By combining the results of Lemmas~\ref{lem. greedy Eater} and~\ref{lem. induced beliefs}, we see that the induced beliefs along all three equilibrium paths make the actions prescribed by $\sigma^*$ sequentially rational, thereby confirming that $\sigma^*$ is an equilibrium strategy.
\end{sketch}
