  Consider first the case $G\circ\gamma=G\circ\eta$.
  %
  If by contradiction $\gamma_{t}\neq \eta_{t}$, thus, $\gamma([0,1])\not\subset\eta([0,1])$, nor
  $\eta([0,1])\not\subset\gamma([0,1])$.
