  dynamical transport, given by the definition of $\NC^e(N)$,
 i.e., (recall~\eqref{eq:defSN}, for the definition of $\U_{N}$)
  \begin{equation}
    \label{eq:concavity-entropy-in-stability-novel-proof}
    \U_{N-1}((e_{t})_{\sharp}\nu_{n}|\mm_{n})
    \geq
    (1-t)
    \U_{N-1}((e_0)_{\sharp}\nu_{n}|\mm_{n})
    +
