    \U_{N-1}((e_1)_{\sharp}\nu_{n}|\mm_{n})
    .
  \end{equation}  
  %

  \noindent
  {\bf Step 1.} Convergence at $t=0,1$.

  \noindent
Using that $\Ent(\cdot\mid\cdot)$ decreases after push-forward on both
entries (see for instance~\cite[Th.~29.20~(ii)]{villani:oldandnew}), we can estimate
the entropy at the extremals of the interval,
   as follows (assumption~\eqref{eq:assumption-sigma} has been taken
