	\includegraphics[width=1.0\textwidth]{src/figs/wells_standalone.pdf}
	\caption{A) shows the best fits for the 10 nm and 5.2 nm barrier width. Subfigures B) and  C) show the $N_{LO}(q)$ and $\tau_{eff}(q)$ for the 10 nm barrier case for different steady-state well densities.}
