Fig.~\ref{fig:1} illustrates how the percentage of solved instances and the EAMLLE vary with integration time step in problems with clause-to-variable ratio $M/N = 7$.  In these simulations, the system's dynamics continued until a solution was reached or the simulation hit the maximum allowed number of steps.
