  and $$\textbf{UBAP}(X)=\inf\left\{\lambda: \ X \ \text{has the}\ \lambda\text{-UBAP}\right\},$$
  by Lemma \ref{lem3.4}, we have \[1\leq \textbf{BAP}(X) \leq  \frac{1+\textbf{UBAP}(X)}{2}.\]
