\subsubsection{Cleaning and stemming.}
\label{sec:clean}

% As a first step, raw affiliation strings undergo a cleaning process to ensure a standardized format before mapping. This is a technical task developed after reviewing thousands of raw affiliation strings. It involves multiple stages including:

% \begin{itemize}
