\subsubsection{String shortening for universities and entity names.}
\label{sec:short}

In this final step before matching, \thiswork~narrows down the remaining partitions which are not in the organization database, by preserving words near the substring \texttt{``univer''} using the \texttt{window} parameter. 
This parameter gets positive integer values and is used to trim long university-related strings. Any terms that are outside the \texttt{window} are discarded. 
Additionally, if a token contains a keyword from the \texttt{Entities} category (see Section~\ref{sec:filter}), the token is reduced to the keyword. 

