	where $\tfrac{\partial}{\partial V_B}[\tfrac{\partial  c_{do} (V,k,V_B,t) }{\partial V} \big|_{V=V_B}]$ is given in \eqref{eq: dv2 cdo<} resp. \eqref{eq: dv2 cdo>}.
	Then, there exists a $\hat{g}>0$ and a constant $C_{\hat{g}}>0$ such that $|V_B'(g)| \leq C_{\hat{g}}$ and $|\tfrac{\partial c_{do} (V,k,V_B(g),T)}{\partial g}| \leq C_{\hat{g}} (e^{-\nu T}+e^{-rT})$ for all $g \in [0,\hat{g}]$.
